\section*{5. Limitation and discussion}

While our approach exhibits satisfactory performance in the evaluations described, it is essential to recognize the constraints. The algorithm is a procedure with at least quadratic time complexity, and non-deterministic runtime, which is affected by several factors including the sample to be encrypted, camera resolution as well as the noise mask used, can intolerably increase as the mask covers a large area of pixels. In addition, the

